    fix(shared): keep the stale-edit exercise lookup alive across its re-key, pin the switched floor prefetch
    
    The lookup now runs in the composable's scope: onAsked flips the effect's key, which cancelled a request started inside the effect. The plan offline test answers /api/exercises after 300 ms so it pins that; a floor UI test pins the switched flag reaching the prefetch.
    
    Flow-Key: panel-fix-2

diff --git a/shared/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/gymie/shared/ui/workout/WorkoutEditorScreen.kt b/shared/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/gymie/shared/ui/workout/WorkoutEditorScreen.kt
